# venus Stage C (8 Oct 2026): the V4L2 Codec2 service is an AIDL IComponentStore/default. The platform defaults to the
# HIDL Codec2 path (media.c2.hal.selection=hidl, frameworks/av HalSelection.cpp), which never lists AIDL stores, so the
# hardware encoder stayed invisible. ro.vendor.api_level is 202604, so AIDL may be selected; media.swcodec then serves
# the software store over AIDL as well. Installed to system_ext (main init may set this platform property; vendor_init
# may not). Both triggers run before class main starts the media services: the build default fires when init queues
# the existing properties, a persisted 0 from /data fires at post-fs-data.
on property:persist.vendor.a6l.venus=1
    setprop media.c2.hal.selection aidl

on property:persist.vendor.a6l.venus=0
    setprop media.c2.hal.selection hidl

# round 20 (8 Oct 2026): the media service caches MediaCodecList at its first query. When the V4L2 codecs appear later
# (vendor.a6l.venus=ready restarts the Codec2 HAL), restart it so apps see c2.v4l2.* without a reboot.
on property:vendor.a6l.venus=ready && property:sys.boot_completed=1
    restart media
